      <!-- ALIGNMENT vs GHYaf3-d1e819 (Oyta abbreviatio). Very heavy compression: 75 sources -> 48 mapped, 27 dropped.
           Target was bundled; split to 1:1. RESULT: no mapped target maps to >1 source.

           NO TARGET-ONLY MATERIAL: phrases that looked like possible Oyta additions were all verified present
           in the source: Anselm 'de casu dyaboli' (target d1e189) = source d1e203; Anselm 'Cur deus homo c.17'
           (target d1e475) = source d1e580; the 'nullipotens' arguments (target d1e727/d1e904) = source d1e1162/d1e1904.
           So — unlike q6/q5 — this abbreviatio adds nothing new here.

           MEGA-COMPRESSIONS (split to 1:1, but seg mapping is approximate where target paraphrases):
           * Target d1e760 bundled 5 sources -> split d1e760(<-d1e1185) d1e770(<-d1e1223) d1e780(<-d1e1233)
             d1e790(<-d1e1481) d1e800(<-d1e1537). NOTE seg d1e790 also paraphrastically compresses the ad-6m
             peccato-revelatio doctrine (sources d1e1298, d1e1348, d1e1360) - second-pass candidate.
           * Target d1e160 3-way: d1e160(<-d1e183) d1e170(<-d1e191) d1e180(<-d1e203-head); prima conclusio (d1e203)
             continues into d1e189 (Anselm de casu diaboli proof).
           * Target d1e570 split 3-way: d1e570(<-d1e677 Augustine incarnatione auctoritas) + d1e585(<-d1e698 'Probatur
             sequitur quod deus non posset revelare sorti... certo peccato mortali nulla culpa precedente') +
             d1e592(<-d1e720 'Si dicas quod peccabit quamvis non poterit hoc vitare... culpa originalis').
           * Target d1e727: d1e1111->d1e727; source d1e1152 ('non est mihi dubium') folded into d1e727 (dropped); d1e1162->d1e745.
           * Target d1e856: source d1e1631 (Matthew 'qui negaverit me' mortal-sin proof) compressed to 'per quod
             peccavit mortaliter' inside d1e856 (dropped); d1e1641->d1e860.

           SECOND-PASS CANDIDATES (one source spanning multiple targets - could be split source-side):
           d1e203 -> 180,189 ; d1e324 -> 274,281 ; d1e519 -> 427,441 ; d1e1058 -> 689,713.

           DROPPED SOURCE BLOCKS (27, no target parallel - expected for an abbreviatio; mostly the long series of
           arguments/responses about revealing future sin, and the Peter/beata-virgo/John-Baptist material):
           d1e732 d1e771 d1e787 d1e802 d1e812 d1e847 d1e879 d1e954 d1e964 d1e1152 d1e1255 d1e1265
           d1e1279 d1e1298 d1e1348 d1e1360 d1e1382 d1e1449 d1e1459 d1e1586 d1e1631 d1e1683 d1e1705 d1e1719 d1e1748
           d1e1784 d1e1832. -->
